{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a9201758-efde-8d84-93a8-bf76407d6494",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T18:44:45-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gloria Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:41:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:41:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Denise. Good evening. I know is after hours for City Hall, but they told me this number is for the storm problems, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:41:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, you've got the right place. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:41:59-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is the water again at my house, 383 Gibbs Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side. After the nor'easter, the one from Saturday into Sunday, the water is coming down the hill from the next street and goes straight into my yard. Straight. Like a river."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:42:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it still running now, or has it gone down some?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:42:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Some it goes down, but still is a big pond by the fence. And this is not the first time, you understand. Every storm, same thing. I call, somebody says they will look, and nobody comes. Nothing changes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:42:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, that's aggravating. Is the water getting near the house, or is it mostly the yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:42:42-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the yard, the house is okay for now. But the street, the water is going over the sidewalk. The children walk there to the bus, and people with the dogs, they walk right by the edge. I am afraid somebody slips, or a child goes in the water to play."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:43:00-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good point to flag. Let me put down that it's coming off the upper street and crossing the sidewalk, with foot traffic. Do you know if a drain up the hill is blocked, or is it just too much water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:43:15-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I cannot say. I am not going up there, I am on my feet since six this morning. I work in the retail, the seasonal job, and today was very long. I come home, I see this water again, and I say, no, I have to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:43:32-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, you've had a long day. I'll get this written up for the crew tonight so it's in front of them first thing. Gibbs Avenue, 383, water running down from the next street into the yard and over the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:43:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Thank you. And please, can somebody call me back when it is done? I want to know that somebody went and looked, not only that you wrote."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:43:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note a callback request. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:44:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0150. It is the house phone, so if I am not there, it rings and rings, but I am here in the evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:44:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0150. I can't promise you an exact day, since crews are stretched after a storm like this, but the callback is on the ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:44:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I understand they are busy. But I am waiting a long time already, you know? My patience, it is almost finished."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:44:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you, Mrs. Figueroa. If it gets worse tonight, or the water's up near the house, call this line back right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:44:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will do. Thank you, Denise. Have a good night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T18:44:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Get some rest."
    }
  ],
